        }
      ],
      "props": {
        "capabilities": [],
        "code": "rows = []\nfor command in all_commands():\n    if command[\"effect\"] != \"mutating\":\n        continue\n    rows.append({\n        \"key\": command[\"key\"],\n        \"name\": command[\"name\"],\n        \"vendor\": command[\"vendor\"],\n        \"category\": command[\"connector_category\"],\n        \"risk_level\": command[\"risk_level\"],\n        \"permissions\": command[\"required_permissions\"],\n        \"undo\": command.get(\"undo_command\"),\n        \"requires_approval\": command[\"risk_level\"] == \"high\",\n    })\nreturn sorted(rows, key=lambda r: (r[\"risk_level\"] != \"high\", r[\"key\"]))",
        "doc": "Every command that changes something in the estate.\n\nWorth having as its own view: this list is the platform's blast radius. An\nadministrator reviewing what the SOAR is capable of doing to production\nshould be able to read exactly this, and every entry names the permission it\nneeds and the command that undoes it where one exists.",
